### Topic 68 - sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" extension)

### Standard delivery, 2.5 kg -> cost 10.00
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipping/quote?weightKg=2.5

### Express delivery, 2.5 kg -> cost 15.00
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipping/quote?weightKg=2.5&express=true

### Too heavy -> 400 Bad Request (ProblemDetail)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/shipping/quote?weightKg=50

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
